n in blood]\n</p><p><br>\nOrin the Red\n</p>\n</div>    \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714194949\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [vary‐revision‐sha1, no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.054 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.057 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 1804/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 30534/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 7637/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 29/200\nExpensive parser function count: 2/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 2/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0/1000\nLua time usage: 0.011/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 936273/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   44.303      1 Template:MiscItemPage\n100.00%   44.303      1 -total\n 57.96%   25.677      8 Template:Icon_text\n 51.56%   22.840     19 Template:Trim\n 23.02%   10.199      2 Template:Uid\n 16.27%    7.210      3 Template:Icon_link\n 14.15%    6.270      1 Template:Main_only\n 13.58%    6.016      2 Template:Template_style\n 10.80%    4.783      8 Template:Ifempty\n 10.24%    4.537      1 Template:Notes\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key bg3wiki:pcache:idhash:35100-0!canonical and timestamp 20260714194949 and revision id 238803. Rendering was triggered because: unknown\n -->\n</div>"}